      "lines": [
        {
          "clip": "s03-01",
          "start": 0.8,
          "end": 3.861,
          "en": "The owner simply forwards the importer's letter to NanFeng.",
          "zh": "企业主只需把进口商的来信转给南风。",
          "audio": "audio/s03-01.mp3",
          "lead": 0
        },
        {
          "clip": "s03-02",
          "start": 4.31,
          "end": 8.112,
          "en": "From here on, this is the live agent at work, not a replay.",
          "zh": "接下来是真实运行的代理，而不是回放。",
          "audio": "audio/s03-02.mp3",
          "lead": 0
        },
        {
          "clip": "s03-03",
          "start": 8.56,
          "end": 14.417,
          "en": "It reads the letter, re-runs 10,000 cash simulations, and prices every financing option.",
          "zh": "它读取来信，重新运行一万次现金模拟，并为每种融资方案报价。",
          "audio": "audio/s03-03.mp3",
          "lead": 0
        },
        {
          "clip": "s03-04",
          "start": 14.85,
          "end": 18.869,
          "en": "Every step is on the record: which tool, which model, how long it took.",
          "zh": "每一步都有记录：用了哪个工具、哪个模型、耗时多久。",
          "audio": "audio/s03-04.mp3",
          "lead": 0
        },
        {
          "clip": "s03-05a",
          "start": 19.32,
          "end": 20.593,
          "en": "All of that took under a minute.",
          "zh": "整个过程不到一分钟。",
          "audio": "audio/pitch/s03-05a.mp3",
          "lead": 0
        }
      ],
      "chapterStart": true
    },
